(text "CoCo 3 512K SRAM expansion - compact SMD version" (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5822d1b1-2a58-4d62-93de-36cf2dc22b1b))
(text "Fits CN4/CN5/CN6. Remove IC16-IC19 and cut C65, C66 first (as for any 512K upgrade)." (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ecdaae76-571f-497f-8496-1fc9dc44e156))
(text "Write logic (all active low):  ~BHE = ~WE0 XOR 1   ~BLE = ~WE1 XOR 1   ~WE = ~WE1 XOR ~BHE" (at 139.70 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1d1fb187-7fee-4e9f-8c64-5d323fd81af7))
(text "Invalid ~WE0=~WE1=0 gives ~WE=1 (no write). RAS = ~RAS XOR 1 clocks the row register on ~RAS fall." (at 139.70 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bf98a55f-8a44-4156-84b2-4bdc120df14c))
(text "SRAM ~CE = ~CAS (column address valid only while ~CAS low); ~OE tied low." (at 139.70 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b2167cf4-4b74-4e1c-aa15-a218f2727a9b))
(text "Address/data pin order on U1 is permuted for routing; any consistent, unique mapping works." (at 139.70 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd82b588-1fe6-4a3f-826d-5a3f258feef3))
(text "Based on the cc3-512k design by Ciaran Anscomb (CC BY-SA 4.0) - logic per Jim Brain. This derivative is also CC BY-SA 4.0." (at 25.40 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7873d0d9-7eef-42ad-af54-41c7c5186116))
